 it can easily be mistaken for a person's mole. Due to the size of the mic, it cannot relay to the earpiece transceiver from a distance of more than 5m."]]},"3-mal-personal-comlink":{"updated":"2019-08-03","stats":[["Model","Crozo Industrial Products 3-Mal"],["Type","Personal comlink"],["Skill","Communications"],["Cost","250"],["Availability","1"],["Range","50 kilometers over land and up to low orbit"],["Game Notes","Automatically monitors local “standard clear"],["Source","Arms and Equipment Guide (page 86)"]]},"0033x-incendiary-grenade":{"updated":"2010-12-28","stats":[["Model","Greff-Timms Industrial Nitrocellulose Incendiary"],["Type","Explosive"],["Scale","Character"],["Skill","Grenade"],["Cost","300"],["Availability","1, R"],["Range","3-7/20/40"],["Blast Radius","0-2/4/6/10"],["Damage","4D/3D/2D/1D"],["Source","Gundark’s Fantastic Technology (page 42), Tales of the Jedi Companion (page 127), Arms and Equipment Guide (page 33)"]]},"8-guage-shotgun":{"updated":"2010-12-30","stats":[["Model","Adostic Arms 8-Guage Shotgun"],["Type","Projectile shotgun"],["Scale","Character"],["Skill","Firearms: shotgun"],["Ammo","2"],["Cost","500"],["Availability","3, R"],["Range","3-5/10/25"],["Damage","5D"],["Game Notes","-1D damage when used on a target with body armor."],["Source","Cracken’s Rebel Operatives (page 46)"]]},"2-1-assassin-droid":{"updated":"2011-02-22","stats":[["Type","Uulshos 2-1 Justice Droid"],["DEXTERITY","4D"],["KNOWLEDGE","1D"],["MECHANICAL","1D"],["PERCEPTION","4D"],["STRENGTH","5D"],["TECHNICAL","1D"],["Equipped With",""],["Equipment","Modified blaster rifle (6D damage)"],["Move","13"],["Size","1.6 meters"],["Source","Planet of the Mists (page 26)"]]},"501-z-zed-police-droid":{"updated":"2011-02-27","stats":[["Type","501-Z “Unit Zed” Police Droid"],["DEXTERITY","3D"],["KNOWLEDGE","2D"],["MECHANICAL","2D+2"],["PERCEPTION","2D"],["STRENGTH","2D"],["TECHNICAL","2D+2"],["Equipped With",""],["Move","12"],["Size","1.7 meters"],["Cost","15,000 credits"],["Sourc