he handles at those speeds."]]},"4-lom":{"updated":"2011-08-24","stats":[["Type","Industrial Automaton 4-LOM Protocol Droid"],["DEXTERITY","2D"],["KNOWLEDGE","4D"],["MECHANICAL","3D"],["PERCEPTION","4D"],["STRENGTH","2D"],["TECHNICAL","6D"],["Equippped With",""],["Move","10"],["Size","1.6 meters"],["Cost","Not available for sale"],["Equipment","bounty hunter license, Blaster pistol (4D), datapad"],["Source","Bounty Hunters ( Page 75-76 )"]]}}
